1. Scope

This license applies to the original CsiCoGen source code, documentation,
configuration files, pretrained model weights, codebooks, and normalization
statistics made available under this license (the "Materials"). It covers
both CsiCoGen and CsiCoGen-Lite and the sampling implementations supplied with
them. The "Licensors" are the copyright holders of these original Materials.

"Model Assets" means the supplied model weights, codebooks, and normalization
statistics, including copies and modified versions. Modified model weights
include weights obtained by adapting, fine-tuning, combining, or converting
the supplied weights.

Third-party materials, including COST2100 data and third-party software, are
excluded from this license. Their original licenses and notices continue to
apply. This license grants rights only to the extent the Licensors are
entitled to grant them.

2. Noncommercial research permission

Subject to these terms, the Licensors grant you a limited, worldwide,
non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, and modify the
Materials solely for Noncommercial Research.

"Noncommercial Research" means scientific or academic investigation intended
to advance knowledge, rather than to obtain commercial advantage or monetary
compensation from the use of the Materials. Ordinary academic employment,
public or charitable research funding, and publication of research findings
do not, by themselves, make such research commercial.

This permission includes reproducing experiments, evaluating the models, and
making private modifications for Noncommercial Research. Redistribution is
subject to Section 3.

