  b. distribute the original CsiCoGen portions and your modifications to
     those portions under this same license;
  c. identify modified files and describe your changes; and
  d. provide the corresponding source code with any executable distribution.

Redistribution of Model Assets requires prior written authorization from the
Licensors. Without that authorization, you may not publish, mirror, host for
download, sell, sublicense, or otherwise provide the original or modified
Model Assets to another person or organization. Private copies for your own
permitted research are allowed.

You may publish research findings and evaluation results that do not include
Model Assets. Publications using the Materials must acknowledge CsiCoGen and
cite the accompanying article using the citation supplied with the project.

